---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Meet Us | Quick & Funny Musicals';
const pageDescription = 'Learn more about the story and history of Quick & Funny Musicals.';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  canonicalPath="/meet-us"
>
  <Nav slot="before-main" />
  <SiteHeader slot="before-main" />

  <main class="content-page" id="main-content">
    <section class="content-hero" aria-labelledby="meet-us-heading">
      <h1 class="content-hero__heading" id="meet-us-heading">Meet Us</h1>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section meet-us" aria-label="About Quick and Funny Musicals">
      <div class="meet-us__copy">
        <p
          >To understand who we are, we first must take you back. Back to a time long before recorded
          history. Back before Instagram, OpenAI, or even the Kardashians. A year known only as... 2009.</p
        >

        <figure class="meet-us__figure meet-us__figure--left">
          <img
            src="/images/ucb-franklin.jpg"
            alt="Quick and Funny performers at UCB Franklin"
            class="meet-us__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>

        <p
          >Founding members Kathryn Burns and Lindsay Hendrickson had an idea: What if we adapted longtime
          Upright Citizens Brigade show <em class="meet-us__emphasis">Quick &amp; Dirty Musicals</em> to
          something else? Something snappier and more on-the-nose? And thus, <em class="meet-us__emphasis"
            >Quick &amp; Funny Musicals</em
          > was born.</p
        >

        <p
          >For years, it operated as a variety show of 10-minute musicals at UCB in Los Angeles. In 2013,
          company members decided to formalize membership and began creating hour-long musical comedies. To
          date, our company has seen world-class alumni, such as <em class="meet-us__emphasis"
            >Rachel Bloom, Jeff Hiller,</em
          > and <em class="meet-us__emphasis">Eugene Cordero</em>.</p
        >

        <figure class="meet-us__figure meet-us__figure--right">
          <img
            src="/images/fullcompany.jpeg"
            alt="Full Quick and Funny Musicals company"
            class="meet-us__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>

        <p
          >After the Covid-19 pandemic, Q&amp;F was revitalized with a massive audition process and upwards
          of 10 new members who were hungry to take on new ideas, new shows, and new laughs! Since then, we
          have reliably performed in Los Angeles nearly every single month, presenting new shows up to 6
          times per year.</p
        >

        <p
          >In 2026, we developed fan-favorite <a
            href="https://heatedrivalrymusicalparody.com"
            class="meet-us__emphasis meet-us__emphasis-link"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Heated Rivalry: The Musical Parody</a
          > which celebrated 10 consecutive sold-out performances in LA, and a massively successful Edinburgh
          Fringe Festival run. We can&rsquo;t wait to keep developing and performing new shows for years to
          come!</p
        >

        <figure class="meet-us__figure meet-us__figure--left">
          <img
            src="/images/shows/heatedrivalry/heatedrivalry13.webp"
            alt="Heated Rivalry stage performance"
            class="meet-us__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>

        <p>Please join our mailing list to stay up to date on all things Q&amp;F!</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter slot="after-main" />

  <script slot="scripts" defer src="/js/meet-us.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
